# UltimateOCR

UltimateOCR is a next-generation OCR engine designed with an ONNX-first architecture.

## Goals

- State-of-the-art text detection
- State-of-the-art text recognition
- Cross-platform deployment
- Modular architecture
- Research-friendly
- Production-ready

## Current Status

Foundation Phase
